{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fell asleep studying for exams\u2026 when you woke up the school was empty. Survive the night, identify what\u2019s wrong, and escape the loop or be stuck at school forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study Time Anomaly should take around 30 to 90 minutes to complete across the multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search the school</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/02fe661a782c3041a64dfb3de342523d.poster.avif?t=1755761084\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/02fe661a782c3041a64dfb3de342523d.webm?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/02fe661a782c3041a64dfb3de342523d.mp4?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something isn't quite right. You fell asleep while studying and are stuck in your school hallway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/2481fbbf9f240438117078bf3c54c095.poster.avif?t=1755761084\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/2481fbbf9f240438117078bf3c54c095.webm?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/2481fbbf9f240438117078bf3c54c095.mp4?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for anomalies ranging from curious to lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape... or not</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/19296224f65321a91513c7314937b62c.poster.avif?t=1755761084\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/19296224f65321a91513c7314937b62c.webm?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/extras/19296224f65321a91513c7314937b62c.mp4?t=1755761084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the correct staircase to finally escape the loop and go home... or be stuck forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 anomalies to spot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for anomalies and choose the correct stairs to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies that change across floors based on your decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907440?t=1755761084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907440?t=1755761084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/b1aaf79e6e71207e9d2ea37d32827069c17306cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755761084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907440/b1aaf79e6e71207e9